  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336033,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wā\n哇\nWow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337833,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dài nǐmen kàn le yī gè rìluò\n带你们看了一个日落\nI just showed you guys a sunset"
