  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342600,
    "dDurationMs": 2966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wā gǎnjué tàiyáng luòshān zhīhòu\n哇感觉太阳落山之后\nWow, it feels like after the sun sets"
