    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390700,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jiù jìngjìng de kàn kan dàhǎi\n就静静的看看大海\nJust quietly looking at the ocean"
