  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399500,
    "dDurationMs": 2566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Gěi wǒmen de gǎnjué jiùshì hěn liáokuò de\n给我们的感觉就是很辽阔的\ngives us this feeling of vastness"
