  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404333,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wǒ juéde dàzìrán jiùshì yǒu\n我觉得大自然就是有\nI think nature just has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405966,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "zhè zhǒng hěn shénqí de mèilì\n这种很神奇的魅力\nthis amazing charm"
