  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488200,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kàn zhège ne jiùshì shātān shātān\n看这个呢就是沙滩沙滩\nLook, this is the beach, the beach"
