  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517600,
    "dDurationMs": 4833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bàngwǎn shífēn de hǎimiàn fēicháng de píngjìng píngjìng\n傍晚时分的海面非常的平静平静\nThe sea in the evening is really calm, calm"
