  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531200,
    "dDurationMs": 1366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Píngjìng de hǎimiàn shàng ne\n平静的海面上呢\nOn the calm water"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532566,
    "dDurationMs": 1234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yǒu yī sōu kuàitǐng\n有一艘快艇\nthere's a speedboat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534966,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wā nàge shì kuàitǐng\n哇那个是快艇\nWow, that's a speedboat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536666,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kāi de hěn kuài\n开的很快\nGoing really fast"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539566,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wǒ xiànzài ne\n我现在呢\nRight now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540466,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Shì dūn zài le è hǎitān shàng dūn dūn zhe\n是蹲在了呃海滩上蹲蹲着\nI'm crouching on the, uh, beach, crouching, crouching"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545066,
    "dDurationMs": 1134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hāhāhā dūn zhe\n哈哈哈蹲着\nHahaha, crouching"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547100,
    "dDurationMs": 4033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ránhòu jìngjìng de kànzhe wǒ qiánmiàn de dàhǎi\n然后静静的看着我前面的大海\nAnd just quietly looking at the ocean in front of me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551933,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wǒ xiànzài gēn dàhǎi de jùlí hěn jìn nǐmen kàn\n我现在跟大海的距离很近你们看\nI'm really close to the ocean right now, look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555866,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Érqiě ne xiànzài zhǐyǒu wǒ yī gè rén\n而且呢现在只有我一个人\nAnd right now it's just me here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558466,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wā hǎo shūfu o\n哇好舒服哦\nWow, it feels so good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560200,
    "dDurationMs": 1733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Zhè zhǒng gǎnjué hěn qímiào\n这种感觉很奇妙\nThis feeling is really amazing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563100,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jiùshì zhèyàng jiǎndāndān de tīngzhe dàhǎi\n就是这样简简单单听着大海\nJust simply listening to the ocean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566000,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "de zhè zhǒng pāidǎ zài shātān shàng de shēngyīn\n的这种拍打在沙滩上的声音\nand the sound of it hitting the beach"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569000,
    "dDurationMs": 2466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ránhòu tiānshàng yǒu de shíhòu huì yǒu hǎi'ōu\n然后天上有的时候会有海鸥\nAnd sometimes there are seagulls in the sky"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571466,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nàge yīnggāi shì hǎi'ōu\n那个应该是海鸥\nThose are probably seagulls"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573533,
    "dDurationMs": 1367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hǎi'ōu de jiàoshēng\n海鸥的叫声\nThe sound of seagulls"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575866,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wǒ juéde hǎo píngjìng\n我觉得好平静\nI feel so peaceful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579166,
    "dDurationMs": 934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nǐmen tīng\n你们听\nListen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581200,
    "dDurationMs": 1666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wā hǎo shūfu o\n哇好舒服哦\nWow, it feels so good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584966,
    "dDurationMs": 2534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Zhēn de hěn xiǎng zài zhèlǐ dāi yī yè hāhā\n真的很想在这里待一夜哈哈\nI really want to stay here all night haha"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588133,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hǎilàng de shēngyīn yě hěn hǎotīng āi\n海浪的声音也很好听哎\nThe sound of the waves is really nice too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591266,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ránhòu zhège wǒmen jiào hǎilàng hǎilàng\n然后这个我们叫海浪海浪\nAnd this we call \"hǎilàng,\" waves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595133,
    "dDurationMs": 4033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dāngrán la jīntiān de làng bù dà hěn xiǎo\n当然啦今天的浪不大，很小\nOf course, today the waves aren't big, they're small"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600400,
    "dDurationMs": 1666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jiàn qǐlái de zhèxiē shuǐhuā ne\n溅起来的这些水花呢\nAnd these splashes of water"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602066,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wǒmen jiào lànghuā lànghuā\n我们叫浪花浪花\nwe call \"lànghuā,\" spray"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609066,
    "dDurationMs": 3734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hǎibiān de zhèxiē mùtou de zàoxíng yě hěn qítè\n海边的这些木头的造型也很奇特\nThe shapes of the driftwood on the beach are really unique"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613000,
    "dDurationMs": 1866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fēicháng qítè de zàoxíng\n非常奇特的造型\nReally unique shapes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615900,
    "dDurationMs": 3266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nà wǒ xiān zuò zài zhè kuài mùtou shàng\n那我先坐在这块木头上\nSo let me sit on this piece of wood first"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619200,
    "dDurationMs": 1266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Zuò zuò xiàlái\n坐坐下来\nSit, sit down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621366,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wā wǒ yǐjīng táozuì le\n哇我已经陶醉了\nWow, I'm already mesmerized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624200,
    "dDurationMs": 3966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Táozuì táozuì zài hǎibiān de měijǐng lǐ le hāhā\n陶醉陶醉在海边的美景里了哈哈\nMesmerized by the beautiful scenery at the beach haha"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630900,
    "dDurationMs": 2166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tiānsè yě yuè lái yuè àn le\n天色也越来越暗了\nIt's getting darker and darker"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634300,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ó\n哦\nOh"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637800,
    "dDurationMs": 2866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hǎilàng de shēngyīn yě biàn dà le nǐmen kàn\n海浪的声音也变大了你们看\nThe sound of the waves is getting louder, look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642733,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wā ó\n哇哦\nWow, oh"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645400,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wā zhèlǐ hái yǒu fēngzheng fēngzheng\n哇这里还有风筝风筝\nWow, there are even kites here, kites"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651966,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yǒu rén ne zài zhèbiān fàng fēngzheng fàng fēngzheng\n有人呢在这边放风筝放风筝\nSomeone's flying a kite over here, flying a kite"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657533,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hǎo ba xiànzài tiān yǐjīng yuè lái yuè hēi le\n好吧现在天已经越来越黑了\nAlright, it's getting darker and darker now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659933,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wǒ yào huí jiā le\n我要回家了\nI'm going home"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661733,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Érqiě zhǔyào shì zhèbiān de wénzi hǎo duō ya\n而且主要是这边的蚊子好多呀\nAnd mainly there are so many mosquitoes here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664566,
    "dDurationMs": 1134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Gānggāng zuò zài nàlǐ ne\n刚刚坐在那里呢\nJust now when I was sitting there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665700,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yǒu hǎo duō de wénzi zài wǒ pángbiān fēi\n有好多的蚊子在我旁边飞\nthere were so many mosquitoes flying around me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668866,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wǒ zhēn de tài zhāo wénzi le hāhā\n我真的太招蚊子了哈哈\nI really attract mosquitoes way too much haha"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671733,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nà wǒmen zhè qī jiémù dào zhèlǐ lou\n那我们这期节目到这里喽\nAlright, that's it for today's episode"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673766,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nǐmen kěyǐ yòng jīntiān zhè qī\n你们可以用今天这期\nYou can use today's episode"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675266,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "jiémù qù liàn yī xià zìjǐ de tīnglì\n节目去练一下自己的听力\nto practice your listening"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677300,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kàn kan zìjǐ néng tīngdǒng duōshao hǎo bù hǎo\n看看自己能听懂多少好不好\nSee how much you can understand, okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680000,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Huānyíng nǐmen zài pínglùnqū gàosù wǒ o\n欢迎你们在评论区告诉我哦\nFeel free to let me know in the comments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682566,
    "dDurationMs": 1534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wǒmen xià qī jiémù zàijiàn la\n我们下期节目再见啦\nSee you in the next episode"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684166,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Xièxie nǐmen péibàn wǒ yīqǐ zài\n谢谢你们陪伴我一起在\nThank you for joining me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686266,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hǎibiān dùguò le yī gè měihǎo de yèwǎn\n海边度过了一个美好的夜晚\nfor a beautiful night by the sea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689666,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK wǒmen xià qī zàijiàn báibái\nOK我们下期再见拜拜\nOK, see you next time, bye bye"
    } ]
  } ]
}
